requests.description:
The caller's COMPLETED (submitted) field assessments - the mobile History screen. Newest submission first. Optional `?farmId=<uuid>` scopes to one farm (400 on a malformed farmId). Any authenticated FARMER token.

This complements `GET /assessments/my/fields`, which now returns ONLY pending (not_started + in_progress) fields - completed ones moved here.

Tapping a card opens the read-only detail: `GET /assessments/my/fields/:fieldId/history`.

### Expected (200)
```json
